      "description": "Signature: Cormorant title against the 4px rust bar.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-page-header\"><p class=\"ds-crumb\">Товары и склады › Номенклатура</p><div class=\"ds-title\"><h1>Номенклатура</h1><p>Блюда, товары, рецептуры и правила продажи</p></div></header>",
      "css": ".ds-page-header{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:20px 24px;background:var(--background,#fff7ec)}.ds-crumb{margin:0;color:var(--muted-foreground,#6b6159);font:400 12px/16px 'Golos Text',Arial,sans-serif}.ds-title{border-left:4px solid var(--rust,#a33009);padding-left:12px}.ds-title h1{margin:0;color:var(--foreground,#121316);font:600 32px/36px Cormorant,Georgia,serif}.ds-title p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted-foreground,#6b6159);font:400 14px/20px 'Golos Text',Arial,sans-serif}"
